  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Weight of water on fish <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math>&nbsp;gram</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>bar</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>vap</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>373</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>76</mn><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p>so change in internal energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>in</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>76</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p>",
